      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "衣服格外笔挺又漂亮……！\n简直像是、要去出席什么典礼似的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba67a4e041e25ea08e21a36aeb174d2cc0321bae80bafb2f67b5dd18a73f99b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
