      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了今天，我特意新定制了衣服，\n将仪容仪表收拾到了人生最佳状态。\n似乎先让她大吃一惊了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10c5c851bc9a9b5892ad7de2344586b1454f306e1d4ae2a59a0fa2846079102c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
